```text
Review of Goals
Primary Goal:
◦Create a corridor plan which promotes revitalization, safety, and
complete streets, while being sensitive to current function, property owners,
and maintenance costs.
Phase I Corridor Study Goals:
◦Realistic planning document to guide development of the area.
◦Priority list of future roadway/ infrastructure improvement projects.
◦Develop alternatives for intersection improvements for Walterscheid Blvd.,
South Greeley, Avenue C, and College Drive
◦Develop multi-modal opportunities in the corridor:  options for bicycle,
pedestrian, bus, industrial freight, and passenger vehicle use on Fox Farm
Road.
